{
 "title": "Text Slides in the Editor — LayerCue from Zero, Episode 9",
 "version": 1,
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "chapter": "Opening the editor",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Welcome back! Today, we make text slides in the editor.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Open it with Edit on the switch at the bottom left, or the pencil on a title bar.",
     "pause": 2.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "There's no Save button. Whatever you change is saved, however you leave.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Press Show to come back.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "chapter": "The editor window",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Slides run down the left. New Slide adds one at the end.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Across the top is the ribbon, in four rows.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Row three is everything about letters. Row four: align, outline, shadow and fit.",
     "pause": 1.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Hover any button to see its name.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "chapter": "Typing",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Every new slide comes with an empty text box. Double-click it.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Type straight away. Escape ends typing.",
     "pause": 3.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The thumbnail on the left follows as you type.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "chapter": "Font and size",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Search for a font by any part of its name, then pick a weight.",
     "pause": 2.2,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Font size is a percent of the screen's height, so it looks the same in HD and 4K.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Drag a number's label to change it. Hold Shift for bigger steps.",
     "pause": 2.4,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "chapter": "Readable on any photo",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Now, put a photo behind the words. The Background row imports one, or pastes one you copied.",
     "pause": 2.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "White text over a bright sky almost disappears.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Press Outline. The group turns blue, and the words stand out.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Text shadow works the same way.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "The arrow beside it opens distance, angle and blur. A wide blur keeps the shadow soft.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "White with a black outline reads on a bright sky and a dark stage alike.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "chapter": "When text doesn't fit",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Drag the box smaller. When the words no longer fit, a small blue plus appears under it.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Press it to make the box bigger, or to shrink the text to fit.",
     "pause": 2.2,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Look for this badge in rehearsal.",
     "pause": 0.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "chapter": "Sending from the editor",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Show on output sends the slide you're editing.",
     "pause": 1.8,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "While it's on stage, your edits follow, live.",
     "pause": 1.0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Change the text, and the audience sees it at once.",
     "pause": 2.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Back in Show, the preview already has it.",
     "pause": 1.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "And the slide is named from its first line.",
     "pause": 0.6,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "chapter": "What's next",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You can now make a text slide that reads over any photo.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    },
    {
     "text": "Next time: designing slides, with shapes, pictures and styles.",
     "pause": 0,
     "screen": "",
     "action": "",
     "caption": "",
     "keys": ""
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}